@startuml OAC power up to S5

participant Baseboard
participant OAC 


== OAC Power on from O3 to O5 ==
note left of Baseboard
O3
end note
Baseboard -> Baseboard: Energize primary power bus bar
Baseboard -> OAC: Assert OAC_PWR_EN
OAC -> OAC: Enable VRs, Clocks...
OAC -> Baseboard: Assert OAC_PWR_GD
note right of Baseboard
When multiple OACs are installed within a platform, 
primary power may be applied sequentially. 
As a result, the time between OAC_PWR_GD assertion 
and the next primary power-up event may vary and 
is platform-dependent.
end note
note left of Baseboard
O4
end note

Baseboard -> OAC: Deassert OAC_PLT_RST#
OAC -> OAC: Intialize devices in primary power domain
Baseboard -> OAC: Enumerate Devices
note left of Baseboard
O5
end note

@enduml